Native review of columns 010–018 is in `docs/i18n/global-plan/reviews/native/th-b.md`. Guidance pack was out of scope (part a).

**Verdict:** 3/5 for these columns. 012 is the strongest; 010, 011, 014, 016, 017 are usable legal Thai. 013/015 still read as a Korean blog; 018 is a different, spoken register. No masculine form for Wei Tseng in this set.

**7 P1s:** gym headlines that can be read as the student being ordered to pay; Invest Taiwan `lang=jpn`; comment/always-on CTAs in 013 and 015; FAQ “ไม่ใช่” under the wrong 014 heading; 主動查詢 rendered as “ตรวจสอบด้วยตนเอง”; 投資審議司 named as both a committee and a กรม.

